      "evidence": "The asset has 3 floor slabs (three occupied levels). OSM tags the property with building:levels=3, and City of West Lafayette permit 27954 describes a new three-story BYX/Fairway addition. A street-level Google Maps viewpoint is cited for a dark sloped roof, and the model has a charcoal hipped/gabled roof.",
